$Notes:
Generated by tools/make_extra_missions.py (non-commercial, CC BY-NC-SA with the Diaspora content).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("The fleet is down to its last reserves of tylium. The tanker Cassia and the freighter Hesper are bringing refined fuel from the Ragnar refinery to the jump point, with the frigate Halyard riding shotgun. Red flight escorts them across the last nine kilometres. The Cylons know what that fuel means.", -1)
$end_multi_text

